#!markdown

# 11 · Factor Research

**English.** A factor (value, momentum, quality, …) ranks assets; it is useful if high-ranked assets subsequently outperform low-ranked ones. `Finance.ML` provides Alphalens-style diagnostics — information coefficient (IC), IC decay, quantile returns, long-short spread, turnover — plus time-series factor regressions (Fama-French style alphas and betas), Fama-MacBeth cross-sectional premia and PCA statistical factors.

**Bahasa Indonesia.** Faktor (value, momentum, quality, …) memeringkat aset; faktor berguna bila aset berperingkat tinggi kemudian mengungguli aset berperingkat rendah. `Finance.ML` menyediakan diagnostik ala Alphalens — information coefficient (IC), peluruhan IC, imbal hasil per kuantil, selisih long-short, turnover — serta regresi faktor deret waktu (alpha dan beta ala Fama-French), premi lintas-sektoral Fama-MacBeth dan faktor statistik PCA.

> Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil

#!csharp

#i "nuget: ../artifacts/packages"
#r "nuget: Gravicode.Finance.Core, 0.1.0"
#r "nuget: Gravicode.Finance.Math, 0.1.0"
#r "nuget: Gravicode.Finance.ML, 0.1.0"
#r "nuget: Gravicode.Finance.Visualization, 0.1.0"

using Finance.Core;
using Finance.Mathematics;
using Finance.ML;
using Finance.Visualization;

#!markdown

## A universe with a real factor / Semesta dengan faktor nyata

**EN.** 50 assets over 500 days. Each asset has a persistent "quality" score that adds a small premium to next-day returns; the observed factor is that score plus measurement noise. A market factor drives common movement.

**ID.** 50 aset selama 500 hari. Setiap aset memiliki skor "quality" yang persisten dan menambahkan premi kecil pada imbal hasil hari berikutnya; faktor yang teramati adalah skor tersebut ditambah derau pengukuran. Sebuah faktor pasar menggerakkan pergerakan bersama.

#!csharp

var rng = new FastRandom(31);
int assets = 50, days = 500;
var quality = Enumerable.Range(0, assets).Select(_ => rng.NextGaussian()).ToArray();
var betas = Enumerable.Range(0, assets).Select(_ => 0.6 + 0.8 * rng.NextDouble()).ToArray();
var prices = new List<double[]>();
var factor = new List<double[]>();
var market = new double[days];
var level = Enumerable.Repeat(100.0, assets).ToArray();
for (int t = 0; t < days; t++)
{
    market[t] = 0.0003 + 0.01 * rng.NextGaussian();
    factor.Add(quality.Select(q => q + 0.8 * rng.NextGaussian()).ToArray());
    for (int i = 0; i < assets; i++)
        level[i] *= Math.Exp(betas[i] * market[t] + 0.0006 * quality[i] + 0.015 * rng.NextGaussian());
    prices.Add((double[])level.Clone());
}
Console.WriteLine($"{assets} assets × {days} days");

#!markdown

## Alphalens-style tear sheet / Tear sheet ala Alphalens

**EN.** The IC is the rank correlation between today's factor and tomorrow's returns, computed every day. A mean IC of 0.02–0.05 is already economically meaningful for daily data; the IC information ratio measures its consistency.

**ID.** IC adalah korelasi peringkat antara faktor hari ini dan imbal hasil besok, dihitung setiap hari. Rata-rata IC 0,02–0,05 sudah bermakna secara ekonomi untuk data harian; rasio informasi IC mengukur konsistensinya.

#!csharp

var sheet = FactorResearch.Analyze(factor, prices, quantiles: 5, horizon: 1, maxDecay: 10);
Console.WriteLine($"Mean IC {sheet.MeanIc:F4} ± {sheet.IcStdDev:F4}  IR {sheet.IcInformationRatio:F2}  mean rank IC {sheet.MeanRankIc:F4}  hit rate {sheet.HitRate:P0}");
Console.WriteLine($"Quantile mean daily returns: {string.Join("  ", sheet.QuantileMeanReturns.Select((r, q) => $"Q{q + 1} {r * 1e4:+0.0;-0.0}bp"))}");
Console.WriteLine($"Long-short spread {sheet.LongShortSpread * 1e4:F1} bp/day, top-quantile turnover {sheet.TopQuantileTurnover:P0}");
display(HTML(Charts.Bar(sheet.QuantileMeanReturns.Select((_, q) => $"Q{q + 1}").ToList(), sheet.QuantileMeanReturns.Select(r => r * 1e4).ToList(),
    new ChartOptions { Title = "Mean next-day return by factor quintile (bp)", Height = 280 })));
display(HTML(Charts.Line(new[] { new LineSeries("IC decay", sheet.IcDecay) { Color = "#2DD4BF" } }, new ChartOptions { Title = "IC by horizon (days)", Height = 240 })));

#!markdown

## Factor regressions / Regresi faktor

**EN.** Time-series regression of one asset on the market gives alpha and beta with t-statistics. Fama-MacBeth runs a cross-sectional regression every day and averages the premia, with standard errors from their time series. PCA recovers the dominant market factor statistically.

**ID.** Regresi deret waktu satu aset terhadap pasar memberikan alpha dan beta beserta statistik-t. Fama-MacBeth menjalankan regresi lintas-sektoral setiap hari lalu merata-ratakan preminya, dengan galat standar dari deret waktunya. PCA menemukan kembali faktor pasar yang dominan secara statistik.

#!csharp

var assetReturns = new double[days - 1];
for (int t = 1; t < days; t++) assetReturns[t - 1] = Math.Log(prices[t][0] / prices[t - 1][0]);
var mkt = new Matrix(days - 1, 1);
for (int t = 1; t < days; t++) mkt[t - 1, 0] = market[t];
var exposure = FactorModels.TimeSeriesRegression(assetReturns, mkt, new[] { "Market" });
Console.WriteLine($"Asset 0: true beta {betas[0]:F2}, estimated {exposure.Betas[0]:F2} (t={exposure.BetaTStats[0]:F1}); annual alpha {exposure.AnnualizedAlpha():P2} (t={exposure.AlphaTStat:F1}); R² {exposure.RSquared:F2}");

var cross = new List<double[]>();
var loads = new List<Matrix>();
for (int t = 0; t < days - 1; t++)
{
    cross.Add(Enumerable.Range(0, assets).Select(i => Math.Log(prices[t + 1][i] / prices[t][i])).ToArray());
    var e = new Matrix(assets, 1);
    for (int i = 0; i < assets; i++) e[i, 0] = factor[t][i];
    loads.Add(e);
}
var fm = FactorModels.FamaMacBeth(cross, loads, new[] { "Quality" });
for (int k = 0; k < fm.FactorNames.Length; k++)
    Console.WriteLine($"Fama-MacBeth premium {fm.FactorNames[k]}: {fm.MeanPremia[k] * 1e4:F2} bp/day (t={fm.TStatistics[k]:F2})");

var panel = new Matrix(days - 1, assets);
for (int t = 0; t < days - 1; t++)
    for (int i = 0; i < assets; i++) panel[t, i] = cross[t][i];
var pca = FactorModels.Pca(panel, 3);
Console.WriteLine($"PCA explained variance: {string.Join(", ", pca.ExplainedVarianceRatio.Select(v => v.ToString("P1")))}");
Console.WriteLine($"Correlation of PC1 with the true market factor: {Math.Abs(Stats.Correlation(pca.FactorReturns.Column(0), market[1..])):F3}");
